WEBVTT

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:26.430
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:30.020
I shout out countless times, break out

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:35.210
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:40.500
Hot blood flows through my body

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:44.210
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:50.810
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:56.310
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:01.850
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:05.360
Uncontrollable impulses

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:12.280
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:19.500
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:26.500
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.680
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:36.250
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:40.250
Ladies and Gentlemen! Look!
It's the I-Weapons, the I-Weapons!

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:43.450
"Light"

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:46.740
Hordes of I-Weapons are landing
in Tokyo one after another!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:51.500
There is plenty of room! Please let
the elderly and children go first!

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.540
Line up, quickly!

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:57.130
Please refrain from evacuating by car!
You'll block the thoroughfare!

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.760
Is there really any need to evacuate?

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:09.270
There's no one left now. We have to hurry...

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:10.390
Yeah.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:14.480
Hey, you! What're you doing?!
The I-Weapons are heading this

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.440
Tozawa! What're you just standin' around for?!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.990
There are reports of an X-Con in this area.

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:23.360
Best be careful.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.700
Damn. It's I-Weapons this, X-Cons that...

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.450
Tokyo's filled with monsters!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:29.910
You're wrong.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.580
She ain't a monster.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.420
Huh?

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.670
She ain't no monster!

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.840
Tozawa-Chan...

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.800
What're you talking about?

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.840
Whatever, just get going!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.220
I have somewhere to go now.
Eh?

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:46.470
Take care of Rihoko.

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.510
Tozawa-Chan!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:54.310
Dammit! I can't let this end with
her being treated like a monster!

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:04.240
It's overflowing...

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:11.080
Something incredible inside me!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.420
It's close!

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.040
The Witchblade...

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.420
Maria-sama...

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:25.930
So they're the ones after us?

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:28.350
It seems so.

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:32.430
I can't allow these petty things...

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.640
...to get in my way!

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.440
Neither can we!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.070
So hot-blooded...

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.530
Maria!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:46.950
Where did she

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:48.620
Chief Nishida?!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:53.370
Chief! Maria took Aoi and Asagi
to fight the I-Weapons!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:56.790
I see. I guess they do draw toward each other.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.750
Get the car! And get the equipment ready!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.000
Right!

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.800
This is something you rarely get to see!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:09.550
Flames are rising up all over
the place! Can you see this?!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.390
Berserk I-Weapons are clashing with an X-Con.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:14.640
Neither shows any signs of stopping!

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.560
Oh! This is the X-Con! Please

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.350
Beep.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.400
3rd place, two weeks in a row!
Ooh! Cute girl in glasses!

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.440
Hey! What're you doing, old man?!

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.400
Oh, I'm a fan of hers, you see...

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.650
You dumbass! Turn it back!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.990
Another explosion!
Giant flames are rising from the street!

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.410
Flames shoot up one after the other!

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:38.790
How long will the I-Weapons
and X-Con continue to run berserk?!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.460
Mom...

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.550
It's burning up...

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.310
My body...

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:57.930
It's burning up!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.230
We need to go after it! Quickly!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:39.430
Right!

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:44.020
Yeah, okay, but what're you
gonna do when you do get it?

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:45.360
What am I going to do?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:51.950
Power's a means, not an end.
What is it you really want, Maria-san?

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:56.120
Asagi-san! You're being rude!

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:01.580
All I did was ask.
Well, let's go. I like fighting...

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.470
What is it you really want?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.390
"Sumitomo Publishing"

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:20.600
Anyways, just find out what happened there!

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:24.560
We're not a newspaper, so you
don't need to report in real-time!

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:27.610
Stick close to Douji! Got that?!

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:32.740
Oh, what's up?

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:34.450
I have a good scoop for you.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:38.200
Sorry. I don't need any
non-X-Con stories right now.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.500
It's a huge story.
Eh?

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:45.250
I guarantee its content.
But I want your help. Please!

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:53.880
The X-Con is on the move!
But even as it changes location, the

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.510
Huh? Where's Rihoko?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:58.140
Didn't she go to the restroom with you?

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.720
Not with me...
Eh?!

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.890
She's probably headed for Masamune-Chan!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.770
Hold on! Where are you going?!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.730
A kid's gone missing!
Have you seen her?!

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.900
A kid?!
Yes!

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:14.450
Understood! We'll search for her,
so please return to

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.360
Screw leaving it to you guys!
Rihoko-Chan!

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:20.410
Wait, you can't!
L-Let go!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.790
Hey! You're obstructing police duties!
Then let us go!

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.430
Our Masane-san?!

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:44.940
Are you okay with this?
You've been saving this story for so long...

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:48.440
What good is sitting on it now gonna do?

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.650
Good point.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:53.030
How many I-Weapons do we have?!

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:56.030
56... Now 52.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:59.070
The next wave of I-Weapons
is about to make landfall.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.370
Approximately 800.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.740
We can't do anything with 50 units...

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.370
Sir! It's no use now! Let's pull back!

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:09.750
No. Ota, have the remaining
I-Weapons rush into the enemy!

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.460
Crush as many as we can!

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:12.630
Yes, sir!

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.810
I've finally found it...

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.530
I'll take the Witchblade now.

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:38.360
I'm busy right now.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:41.240
But taking you on sounds like fun...

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:09.980
Stop the car!

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.440
Doctor! It's dangerous here!

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:17.190
Don't you dare drive!

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.860
There's no second chance
for something like this!

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:21.820
But this is !

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:29.580
Mom...

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:30.790
Oh, yeah!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.670
13, 1 2, 1 1 ...

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:37.590
10, 9...

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.470
8, 7...

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:41.380
6, 5...

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:43.510
4, 3...

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.810
2, 1 ...

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.480
All units have self-destructed.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:58.150
25% damage to the opposing I-Weapons!

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:01.530
As before, they're proceeding north-northwest.

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:04.410
Approximately 550 of them...

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.250
So this is it...

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:14.790
"Amaha Masane"

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:17.920
Hey! What are you

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.800
Hello?

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:22.130
I'm sorry for calling you.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:26.350
Umm... Do you know where Mom is?!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:27.220
What?!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:30.100
Where she's fighting...

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.310
Where is she

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:35.360
Don't tell me you plan to go to her?!

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.440
Rihoko!

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:41.110
Don't do anything foolish!
Do you know how dangerous it is?!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.490
You absolutely can't go!

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.910
Where are you?! Who are you with?!

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.710
Are you already outside?! No! Go back!

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:58.630
Rihoko!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:01.920
Rihoko! Rihoko! Ri

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:09.680
Be safe, Takayama-san.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.850
Please be alive!

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.700
Where did all that vigor go?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.580
I'm just getting started!

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:33.710
What? You're already starting to break down.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:38.080
But it feels incredible!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:50.010
Well? How was that?

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:53.060
M-Maria-sama!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.400
Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.530
Damn you! Damn you !

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:07.450
Aoi!

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.910
Couldn't hold herself together...

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:15.540
Aoi...

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:22.170
It's all right, Maria-sama!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:26.800
Please obtain it without hesitation!

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:31.430
You're worthiest to have the Witchblade...

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:45.820
What exactly are you planning to use this for?

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:56.910
You acted all high and mighty,
but I see you're empty, too...

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:01.840
No! There is something I seek!

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.380
No...

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:11.300
This girl is just like the
Witchblade and the l-Weapons!

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:13.510
I can't leave her with Riko...

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:19.270
I'll take her with me!

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:23.520
Yes.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:25.570
That's a good place.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.820
Damn it!

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:25.540
Mom!

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:38.390
What is this?! This is more than incredible!

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:40.930
It's enough to blow up all of Tokyo if

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:49.190
That's right! Over here! Don't get sidetracked!

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:57.120
Huh?

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.000
Using your power for something like this...

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.790
It's incomprehensible.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:08.290
Yeah. I bet it might be, for you...

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:14.470
I have no need to comprehend.
The Witchblade is all I want.

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.100
No! I refuse to hand it over!

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:28.980
There!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.370
Can you see this, ladies and gentlemen?!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:46.710
Throngs of I-Weapons have
crowded around the Tokyo Tower!

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.460
Meanwhile, the person
reported to be an X-Con...

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:52.380
...appears to be fighting atop the tower!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.380
The other person is a so-called "Neo-Gene,"

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:58.930
created by the world-famous welfare group NSWF!

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:03.640
But, ladies and gentlemen,
none of these are monsters or machines!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:07.600
They're people just like us!
They are all human!

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:12.480
Also, people known as "Sisters" were
created by the NSWF's Mr. Furumizu...

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:15.860
...through bio-technology and inbreeding!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:18.870
We've also learned that the
I-Weapons are in fact weapons...

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:22.450
...constructed by Douji Industries
using the bodies of the deceased.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:26.040
Detailed investigations into
these matters are expected.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:31.340
Catch, row! Catch, row!
That's it! Good job, Takayama!

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:34.050
This monster that was previously
thought to be an X-Con

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:36.470
No!

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:39.890
She's not a monster!

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:42.390
She's a regular person!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.720
A mother!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:51.560
You're all beat-up now!

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:55.860
Just hand over the
Witchblade! It belongs to me!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:58.400
Once I have it, I'll...

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.530
You'll... what?!

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:11.130
Mommy...

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:18.630
I see. So that's what you wanted...

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:23.640
Hey, Mommy... Do you love m

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.700
Mom, huh...

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:45.410
Could it be that you all also

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:49.620
Yeah.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.540
That might be for the best, too.

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:39.380
Mom!

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.930
Riko...

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:49.600
I'll always be by your side...

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:54.020
So this isn't where you belong.

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:57.440
It's right there...

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:59.650
Rihoko!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:01.280
Thank goodness...

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:09.120
Takayama-san! Mom is

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:44.950
Riko...

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:56.510
Holding hands in the middle of this silence

00:20:56.510 --> 00:21:03.540
Our hearts are beating with the same blood

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:08.450
We left town together

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:14.860
And ended up in this little room, with one flower on the wall

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:17.680
There's nothing that can replace you

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.680
You're the only think I want to protect

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:26.790
There's no need to make sure

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:29.650
I want us to become one

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:32.660
And hold a bond that will never change

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:41.250
in the past, present, or future.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:44.820
Hold me closer, get closer

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:47.230
Take away my loneliness

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:50.890
Hold me closer, get closer

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:53.200
I want you to trust me

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:56.760
Hold me closer, get closer

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:59.240
Through the endless darkness

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:00.400
Hold me closer, get closer

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:05.650
You are me and I am you

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:10.370
Oh darling, stand by me...

00:23:01.630 --> 00:23:03.000
Mom...
